<title>USA: Franklin nominee wins Telephone &amp; Data seat.</title>
<headline>Franklin nominee wins Telephone &amp; Data seat.</headline>
<dateline>SHORT HILLS, N.J. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Mutual Advisers Inc, a unit of Franklin Resources Inc, on Friday said that its candidate has won a seat of the board of directors of Telephone and Data Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Franklin said Martin Solomon was elected to the 11-member board, according to preliminary results of proxies.</p>
<p>The final vote count will not be available for &quot;a couple of weeks,&quot; the company said.</p>
</text>
